      <div data-dc-tpl="977" style="position: relative; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; border-radius: 18px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(185, 156, 102, 0.3); background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgb(28, 27, 24) 0px, rgb(28, 27, 24) 14px, rgb(32, 30, 25) 14px, rgb(32, 30, 25) 28px); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><div data-dc-tpl="978" style="text-align: center; padding: 20px;"><div data-dc-tpl="979" style="font-family: &quot;Archivo Black&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(246, 239, 228);">Map placeholder</div><div data-dc-tpl="980" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(185, 156, 102); margin-top: 4px;">Gaithersburg to I-270 N to Century Blvd</div></div></div>
